  "content": "\n\n<h1><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/2afbeabadf7e4c81d517f794066466f90d1f2f1a.png\" alt=\"IrisSearch_logo\" width=\"60\" height=\"auto\"> &nbsp; Iris &amp; Oculus Search</h1>\n<div style=\"display:flex;text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.euphoriapatches.com%252fdiscord%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Discord\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Discord-050d18?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=black&labelColor=e5f7ff\"> </a><a href=\"https://github.com/SpacEagle17/IrisSearch\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Source\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Source-050d18?style=for-the-badge&logo=github&logoColor=black&labelColor=e5f7ff\"> </a><img alt=\"Iris Search\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Iris | Oculus | and derivatives-050d18?style=for-the-badge&logoColor=black&label=WORKS ON:&labelColor=050d18&color=e5f7ff\"> &nbsp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.euphoriapatches.com%252fsupport%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Support\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Spaceagle17-050d18?style=for-the-badge&logo=patreon&logoColor=black&label=Support&labelColor=e5f7ff\"></a></div>\n<h2>一款提升便利性的模組，直接在 Iris 或 Oculus 的光影設定畫面中加入實用的搜尋列，讓您能立即找到特定的光影選項。</h2>\n<h2>🔍 為什麼要使用此模組？</h2>\n<p>厭倦了為了尋找「樹葉搖曳」或「泛光效果」等特定開關，而不斷點擊無數頁面與子選單嗎？</p>\n<p><strong>Iris & Oculus Search</strong> 將搜尋列直接嵌入光影選項的圖形介面中。輸入您需要的關鍵字，選單就會動態篩選出相符的設定。它完整支援 <strong>Fabric</strong> 或 <strong>NeoForge</strong> 上的 <strong>Iris</strong>，以及 <strong>Forge</strong> 上的 <strong>Oculus</strong>！</p>\n<h2>功能特色</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>在圖形介面中無縫搜尋光影設定</strong> 或 <strong>光影包</strong></li>\n<li><strong>介面內建搜尋列：</strong>在光影包選項選單與光影包選擇畫面中，直接加入無縫整合的文字輸入欄位</li>\n<li><strong>多語言支援：</strong>可使用您選擇的語言進行搜尋（若該光影支援）。本模組本身也支援翻譯。歡迎前往 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcrowdin.com%252fprofile%252fspaceagle17\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Crowdin</a> 貢獻您的力量。</li>\n<li><strong>無需設定：</strong>安裝後即可直接使用，完全不需要編輯任何設定檔。</li>\n<li><strong>載入器相容性：</strong>支援 <strong>Fabric</strong> 與 <strong>NeoForge</strong> 上的 <strong>Iris</strong>，以及 <strong>Forge</strong> 上的 <strong>Oculus</strong>。</li>\n<li><strong>版本支援：</strong>相容於 <strong>1.20.1+</strong> 至最新版的 Minecraft。</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n  <p><strong>⚠️ 注意：</strong>此模組需要安裝 <strong>Iris</strong> 或 <strong>Oculus</strong> 其中之一作為必要依賴項。若未安裝其中任一個，模組將無法運作。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fyoutu.be%252frLCE-IV_fng\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fa075629-4a4e-48b6-8c27-effac8420b9f\" alt=\"YouTube 影片\"></a></p>\n<h2>相關連結</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>在 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.euphoriapatches.com%252fsupport%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patreon 或 Kofi</a> 上支持 SpacEagle17</strong></li>\n<li><strong>聯絡方式：</strong> <strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252feuphoriapatches.com%252fcontact\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://euphoriapatches.com/contact</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong>Discord 伺服器：</strong> <strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.euphoriapatches.com%252fdiscord\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.euphoriapatches.com/discord</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong>Iris &amp; Oculus Search</strong> 的 <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/SpacEagle17/IrisSearch\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a></strong> 原始碼</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>由 Ember Host 贊助</h2>\n<p>正在尋找價格實惠且可靠的 Minecraft 伺服器主機嗎？Ember Host 提供極高的性價比與頂級技術支援！</p>\n<p>點擊廣告橫幅或在結帳時輸入優惠碼 <strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.euphoriapatches.com%252fember-referral\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">EUPHORIA</a></strong>，首購即可享 <strong>10%</strong> 折扣。此外，您的消費金額中有 <strong>70%</strong> 將用於支持 Iris &amp; Oculus Search 的開發！</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbit.ly%252f0932rwjieopf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.euphoriapatches.com/assets/img/other/ember_host_ep.png\" alt=\"\"></a></p>",
